<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"><ttm:name type="full">當山みれい</ttm:name></ttm:agent><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters></songwriters><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">终于能够一起连休</text><text for="L2">相依着在房间里</text><text for="L3">制定旅游计划</text><text for="L4">看着手机和旅游指南</text><text for="L5">一来一回交流讨论的时间</text><text for="L6">已经承载着我的快乐</text><text for="L7">被倒映在水面上樱花照耀了的春天</text><text for="L8">穿着一起挑选的泳衣嬉笑玩耍的夏天</text><text for="L9">一起在被秋色浸染的</text><text for="L10">鳞次栉比的杏树下散步</text><text for="L11">在白雪皑皑覆盖的树下同欢共笑</text><text for="L12">无论是快乐的日子 还是不甘现状的日子</text><text for="L13">都想在身旁听你倾诉</text><text for="L14">无论何时</text><text for="L15">都想和你一直在一起的春夏秋冬</text><text for="L16">今年春天我们去哪里呢？</text><text for="L17">今年夏天我们去哪里呢？</text><text for="L18">无论是春天的樱花还是夏天的大海</text><text for="L19">都想与你共赏</text><text for="L20">想要你在我身旁</text><text for="L21">今年秋天我们去哪里呢？</text><text for="L22">今年冬天我们去哪里呢？</text><text for="L23">秋天的红叶以及冬天的白雪</text><text for="L24">都想与你共赏</text><text for="L25">想要你在我身旁</text><text for="L26">那些对我而言的特别的日子</text><text for="L27">觉得是理所当然</text><text for="L28">而我却又贪得无厌</text><text for="L29">什么才是真正的爱呢？</text><text for="L30">过分追求形式</text><text for="L31">反而错过了许多</text><text for="L32">当你指责颓废的我时</text><text for="L33">我才发现</text><text for="L34">比我更加了解自己的</text><text for="L35">正是你呀</text><text for="L36">也只有你呀</text><text for="L37">我不够坦率</text><text for="L38">也没有那么可爱</text><text for="L39">和我在一起真的好吗</text><text for="L40">有时候我总会因此而感到不安</text><text for="L41">但，如果是和你一起</text><text for="L42">我愿许下永恒的誓言</text><text for="L43">羁绊着我们无名指的证明</text><text for="L44">教会的钟声响起</text><text for="L45">与羞涩的你</text><text for="L46">四目相对 爱恋交汇</text><text for="L47">一起去寻找</text><text for="L48">新的风景吧</text><text for="L49">寻找你我二人的春夏秋冬</text><text for="L50">今年春天我们去哪里呢？</text><text for="L51">今年夏天我们去哪里呢？</text><text for="L52">无论是春天的樱花还是夏天的大海</text><text for="L53">都想与你共赏</text><text for="L54">想要你在我身旁</text><text for="L55">今年秋天我们去哪里呢？</text><text for="L56">今年冬天我们去哪里呢？</text><text for="L57">秋天的红叶以及冬天的白雪</text><text for="L58">都想与你共赏</text><text for="L59">想要你在我身旁</text><text for="L60">无论是特别的纪念日</text><text for="L61">还是平平无奇的日常</text><text for="L62">都满载着你为我创造的回忆</text><text for="L63">无论是哪里</text><text for="L64">你都会带着我去</text><text for="L65">告诉了许多好玩的地方</text><text for="L66">但其实呀</text><text for="L67">目的地不重要</text><text for="L68">让我世界大放异彩的</text><text for="L69">正是你呀</text><text for="L70">如果以后</text><text for="L71">我们有了孩子</text><text for="L72">只有这个地方</text><text for="L73">一定要告诉他</text><text for="L74">那就是</text><text for="L75">我们交换誓言的</text><text for="L76">那个夏末</text><text for="L77">我们一同歌颂爱情的圣地</text><text for="L78">今年春天我们去哪里呢？</text><text for="L79">今年夏天我们要哪里呢？</text><text for="L80">无论是春天的樱花还是夏天的大海</text><text for="L81">都想与你共赏</text><text for="L82">想要你在我身旁</text><text for="L83">今年秋天我们去哪里呢？</text><text for="L84">今年冬天我们去哪里呢？</text><text for="L85">秋天的红叶以及冬天的白雪</text><text for="L86">都想与你共赏</text><text for="L87">想要你在我身旁</text><text for="L88">今年春天我们去哪里呢？</text><text for="L89">今年夏天我们去哪里呢？</text><text for="L90">无论是春天的樱花还是夏天的大海</text><text for="L91">都想与你共赏</text><text for="L92">想要你在我身旁</text><text for="L93">今年秋天我们去哪里呢？</text><text for="L94">今年冬天我们去哪里呢？</text><text for="L95">秋天的红叶以及冬天的白雪</text><text for="L96">都想与你共赏</text><text for="L97">想要和你一起</text><text for="L98">和你一起...</text><text for="L99">和你一起...</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body><div itunes:song-part="Verse"><p begin="0:00.750" end="0:04.280" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:00.750" end="0:01.110">や</span><span begin="0:01.110" end="0:01.310">っ</span><span begin="0:01.310" end="0:01.620">と</span><span begin="0:01.620" end="0:01.860">一</span><span begin="0:01.860" end="0:02.170">緒</span><span begin="0:02.170" end="0:02.810">に</span><span begin="0:02.810" end="0:03.020">取</span><span begin="0:03.020" end="0:03.230">れ</span><span begin="0:03.230" end="0:03.450">た</span><span begin="0:03.450" end="0:03.820">連</span><span begin="0:03.820" end="0:04.280">休</span></p><p begin="0:04.490" end="0:05.990" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:04.490" end="0:04.760">部</span><span begin="0:04.760" end="0:05.000">屋</span><span begin="0:05.000" end="0:05.150">で</span><span begin="0:05.150" end="0:05.430">寄</span><span begin="0:05.430" end="0:05.560">り</span><span begin="0:05.560" end="0:05.810">添</span><span begin="0:05.810" end="0:05.890">っ</span><span begin="0:05.890" end="0:05.990">て</span></p><p begin="0:05.990" end="0:07.680" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:05.990" end="0:06.400">計</span><span begin="0:06.400" end="0:06.840">画</span><span begin="0:06.840" end="0:07.130">を</span><span begin="0:07.130" end="0:07.340">練</span><span begin="0:07.340" end="0:07.680">る</span></p><p begin="0:07.900" end="0:10.780" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:07.900" end="0:08.110">ス</span><span begin="0:08.110" end="0:08.380">マ</span><span begin="0:08.380" end="0:08.570">ホ</span><span begin="0:08.570" end="0:08.830">と</span><span begin="0:08.830" end="0:09.090">ガ</span><span begin="0:09.090" end="0:09.270">イ</span><span begin="0:09.270" end="0:09.440">ド</span><span begin="0:09.440" end="0:09.630">ブ</span><span begin="0:09.630" end="0:09.720">ッ</span><span begin="0:09.720" end="0:09.830">ク</span><span begin="0:09.830" end="0:10.250">眺</span><span begin="0:10.250" end="0:10.520">め</span><span begin="0:10.520" end="0:10.780">て</span></p><p begin="0:10.940" end="0:12.660" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:10.940" end="0:11.370">話</span><span begin="0:11.370" end="0:11.610">し</span><span begin="0:11.610" end="0:11.760">合</span><span begin="0:11.760" end="0:11.830">う</span><span begin="0:11.830" end="0:12.020">時</span><span begin="0:12.020" end="0:12.460">間</span><span begin="0:12.460" end="0:12.660">が</span></p><p begin="0:12.660" end="0:14.360" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:12.660" end="0:12.780">も</span><span begin="0:12.780" end="0:13.070">う</span><span begin="0:13.070" end="0:13.500">楽</span><span begin="0:13.500" end="0:13.690">し</span><span begin="0:13.690" end="0:13.950">く</span><span begin="0:13.950" end="0:14.360">て</span></p></div><div itunes:song-part="PreChorus"><p begin="0:14.640" end="0:17.790" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:14.640" end="0:14.730">水</span><span begin="0:14.730" end="0:14.950">面</span><span begin="0:14.950" end="0:15.340">に</span><span begin="0:15.340" end="0:15.650">映</span><span begin="0:15.650" end="0:15.850">る</span><span begin="0:15.850" end="0:16.510">桜</span><span begin="0:16.510" end="0:17.150">輝</span><span begin="0:17.150" end="0:17.320">く</span><span begin="0:17.320" end="0:17.790">春</span></p><p begin="0:17.950" end="0:21.270" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:17.950" end="0:18.210">一</span><span begin="0:18.210" end="0:18.430">緒</span><span begin="0:18.430" end="0:18.660">に</span><span begin="0:18.660" end="0:19.030">選</span><span begin="0:19.030" end="0:19.140">ん</span><span begin="0:19.140" end="0:19.260">だ</span><span begin="0:19.260" end="0:19.690">水</span><span begin="0:19.690" end="0:19.970">着</span><span begin="0:19.970" end="0:20.130">で</span><span begin="0:20.130" end="0:20.590">遊</span><span begin="0:20.590" end="0:20.800">ぶ</span><span begin="0:20.800" end="0:21.270">夏</span></p><p begin="0:21.420" end="0:22.980" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:21.420" end="0:21.830">秋</span><span begin="0:21.830" end="0:22.140">色</span><span begin="0:22.140" end="0:22.300">に</span><span begin="0:22.300" end="0:22.560">染</span><span begin="0:22.560" end="0:22.760">ま</span><span begin="0:22.760" end="0:22.980">る</span></p><